      "text": "Mira resent the proposed scope: remove the existing screen, taps, and valve; install cladding to the walls and riser with chrome trims; fit new bath taps and a new valve; refit the existing screen. She said the contractor had not provided separate line-item prices and repeated the £2,844.00 total.",
